1. Convert an integer to its English word representation:

```python
def int_to_english(num):
    if num == 0:
        return "zero"
    elif num > 0:
        words = []
        while num > 0:
            words.append(str(num % 10))
            num //= 10
        return " ".join(reversed(words))
    else:
        return f"negative {int_to_english(-num)}"
```

